  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Direct Coffee Trade and Capacity Building</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Gosling Coffee B.V. imports coffee through direct trade from Peru, Colombia, Uganda and Tanzania. With the support of DGGF-TA they imported 1.5 containers total and supported the build of a drying beds in Uganda to increase the quality of the coffee beans. Direct Trade is leading to direct impact with the local farmers. Gosling Coffee works closely with the farmers and corporations on the basis of an equal partnership, through which they empower the producers and start up conversations on putting women in leadership roles. With this project 46 indirect FTE were supported and a total of 204 people benefited from trainings regarding producing a higher quality product and sustainable production methods.</narrative>
  </description>
